<title>DENMARK: East Asiatic 1996 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>East Asiatic 1996 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31 1996</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net result			  201 vs 338</p>
<p> Group pre-tax/extra.items result     343 vs 216</p>
<p> Group net turnover		    16,454 vs 14,421</p>
<p> Group operating result		  402  vs 422</p>
<p> Dividend (Dkk per share)		    nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish wholesale, graphic and shipping group is East Asiatic A/S (EAC). It said in a statement that it expected operating profits in 1997 to be &quot;reasonably better&quot; than in 1996. The result was below analyst expectations of an average 1996 profit before tax and extraordinary items profit of 357 million crowns. --Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
